ine/godot/pulls/121638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121638","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121638.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121638.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-22T18:53:44Z"},"body":"- Supersedes #104852\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nGives uniformity to our core logic that relies on narrowing templates to their basic types by wholly replacing `GetSimpleTypeT` (an alias for `std::remove_cv_t<std::remove_reference_t<T>>`) with the far more appropriate and less verbose `std::decay_t`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nOriginally I thought we'd just drop this once the C++20 `std::remove_cvref_t` was a thing, but given `std::decay_t` is more appropriate to begin with, it makes more sense to make this transition now.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121638/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/